{
  "name": "Neretxaus - 2. Motor de Matching IA (Híbrido)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 6
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "node-cron",
      "name": "Cron (Cada 6h) o Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 1. Disparador\n**Función:**\nArranca el proceso automáticamente.\n\n**Configuración:**\nPuedes forzarlo manualmente con Execute.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 180
      },
      "id": "sticky-1",
      "name": "Nota 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        50
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "=SELECT c.id as client_id, c.first_name, s.search_prompt, s.budget_max, s.preferred_areas \nFROM app_core.clients c \nJOIN app_core.client_search_profiles s ON c.id = s.client_id \nWHERE c.is_active = true;"
      },
      "id": "node-get-clients",
      "name": "Obtener Clientes y Perfiles",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        200,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 2. Extractor Clientes\n**Función:**\nSaca de la base de datos a los clientes activos.\n\n⚠️ **CRÍTICO:** Selecciona tu credencial de Postgres.",
        "color": 6,
        "height": 220,
        "width": 180
      },
      "id": "sticky-2",
      "name": "Nota 2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        200,
        50
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "batchSize": 1,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "node-loop",
      "name": "Loop (Por cada Cliente)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        400,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 3. Bucle Clientes\n**Función:**\nItera cliente por cliente para no mezclar las búsquedas.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 180
      },
      "id": "sticky-3",
      "name": "Nota 3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        400,
        50
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "=SELECT id as property_id, tipo_activo, precio_venta, direccion, provincia \nFROM assets.properties \nWHERE precio_venta <= {{ $json.budget_max }} \nORDER BY created_at DESC LIMIT 5;"
      },
      "id": "node-pre-filter",
      "name": "Pre-Filtro SQL Rápido",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        600,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 4. Filtro SQL Lógico\n**Función:**\nFiltra propiedades por precio máximo.\n\n⚠️ **CRÍTICO:** Selecciona tu credencial de Postgres.",
        "color": 6,
        "height": 220,
        "width": 180
      },
      "id": "sticky-4",
      "name": "Nota 4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        600,
        50
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://ollama:11434/api/generate",
        "sendBody": true,
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "model",
              "value": "qwen2.5:7b-instruct"
            },
            {
              "name": "prompt",
              "value": "=Evalúa si esta propiedad ({{ $json.tipo_activo }} en {{ $json.provincia }} por {{ $json.precio_venta }}€) es un buen match para un cliente que busca: \"{{ $(\"Loop (Por cada Cliente)\").item.json.search_prompt }}\".\n\nDevuelve un JSON con el siguiente formato:\n{\n  \"match_score\": número entero del 0 al 100,\n  \"reason\": \"Breve frase de 15 palabras explicando por qué encaja o por qué no\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "stream",
              "value": "false"
            },
            {
              "name": "format",
              "value": "json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "node-ollama",
      "name": "Ollama API (Evaluación IA)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.1,
      "position": [
        800,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 5. Evaluador IA Local\n**Función:**\nCruza Perfil con Propiedad (Score).\n\n**Config:**\nInterno, sin credencial.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 180
      },
      "id": "sticky-5",
      "name": "Nota 5",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        800,
        50
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "try {\n  let raw = $input.item.json.response;\n  raw = raw.replace(/```json\\n/g, '').replace(/```/g, '').trim();\n  const parsedData = JSON.parse(raw);\n  return { json: parsedData };\n} catch (error) {\n  return { json: { match_score: 0, reason: 'Error de IA' } };\n}"
      },
      "id": "node-sanitize",
      "name": "Sanitizar IA",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1000,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 6. Sanitizador JSON\n**Función:**\nLimpia fallos Markdown de la IA. Fallback al 0%.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 180
      },
      "id": "sticky-6",
      "name": "Nota 6",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1000,
        50
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "number": [
            {
              "value1": "={{ $json.match_score }}",
              "operation": "largerEqual",
              "value2": 70
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "node-if",
      "name": "Filtro (> 70% Match)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1200,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 7. IF Lógico\n**Función:**\nDescarta por debajo del 70%.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 180
      },
      "id": "sticky-7",
      "name": "Nota 7",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1200,
        50
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "=INSERT INTO app_core.asset_matches (client_id, property_id, ai_score, match_reason, status) \nVALUES ('{{ $(\"Loop (Por cada Cliente)\").item.json.client_id }}', '{{ $(\"Pre-Filtro SQL Rápido\").item.json.property_id }}', {{ $json.match_score }}, '{{ $json.reason }}', 'PENDING') \nON CONFLICT (client_id, property_id) DO UPDATE SET ai_score = EXCLUDED.ai_score, match_reason = EXCLUDED.match_reason;"
      },
      "id": "node-save",
      "name": "Guardar Matches (PostgreSQL)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        1400,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 8. Guardar Match\n**Función:**\nGuarda en DB para la UI.\n\n⚠️ **CRÍTICO:** Selecciona tu credencial de Postgres.",
        "color": 6,
        "height": 220,
        "width": 180
      },
      "id": "sticky-8",
      "name": "Nota 8",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1400,
        50
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Cron (Cada 6h) o Webhook": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Obtener Clientes y Perfiles",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Obtener Clientes y Perfiles": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Loop (Por cada Cliente)",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Loop (Por cada Cliente)": {
      "main": [
        [],
        [
          {
            "node": "Pre-Filtro SQL Rápido",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Pre-Filtro SQL Rápido": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Ollama API (Evaluación IA)",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Ollama API (Evaluación IA)": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
